<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — Kreetle creature port (Pass 15).
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Kreetle` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  Body: the donor's custom `Kreetle` BodyDef (Bodies_Animal_StarWars.xml) is
  entirely vanilla-part composition — Shell/Elytra x3/Stomach/InsectHeart/
  Pronotum/InsectHead/Brain/Eye x2/InsectNostril/InsectMouth/InsectLeg x6,
  confirmed by reading the donor's own BodyDef directly, no SW-prefixed part
  or group anywhere — defName rename only, ported as RSW_Kreetle
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml).

  `leatherDef` repoints to the already-ported `RSW_Leather_Insectine`
  (Pass 13, texPath swresource/Leather_Chitin) — the same resource Krykna
  this same pass and Kinrath (Pass 13) already use. `useMeatFrom` stays
  vanilla Core `Megaspider` (no specificMeatDef in the donor). No eggs — the
  donor gives live birth via `gestationPeriodDays`/`litterSizeCurve`, not
  `CompProperties_EggLayer`. No new resource needed.

  No ability: the donor's own `specialTrainables` are unset; only comps are
  `CompProperties_CanBeDormant`/`CompProperties_WakeUpDormant`, vanilla Core.

  🔴 **ArtOverride collision avoided, checked BEFORE extracting anything**:
  `KreetleArtOverride` (mandrake.rsw.kreetleartoverride) exists and covers
  the adult `Kreetle_{south,east,north}` facings only — its own About.xml
  says the juvenile "maggot" stage and the dessicated-corpse texture stay on
  donor art. SWBestiary ships ONLY `Kreetle_j_{south,east,north}`,
  `Kreetle_j_Dessicated`, and `Kreetle_Dessicated` — the adult base facing is
  NOT extracted here.

  Art: 5 PNGs extracted this pass via extract_bundle.py against the same
  AssetBundle every prior wave used — `Kreetle_j_south`, `Kreetle_j_east`,
  `Kreetle_j_north`, `Kreetle_j_Dessicated`, `Kreetle_Dessicated`, all
  confirmed non-zero and PIL-openable. Sits at Textures/swanimals/Kreetle/.

  Sounds already absorbed in the 2026-09-02 sound wave
  (`RSW_Pawn_Kreetle_*`) — confirmed present, wired, not re-done.

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: per cast_assignment.csv's own
  ground truth (AB_FeraliskInfestedJungle, AB_MiasmicMangrove,
  AridShrubland, Desert, ExtremeDesert).
-->
<Defs>
<ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
